	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"偉大なる船コレクション初の飛行タイプの船が登場！",
			"• ワンピース第30巻に登場するエネルの船「方舟マクシム」が立体化。",
			"• 船体横のプロペラはそれぞれが独立して回転でき、シリーズ初の飛行再現が可能！",
			"• 特徴的な顔部分はグロスインジェクションで驚きのツヤ感に。",
			"• 空に浮かぶマクシムを再現するための新規ディスプレイパーツや白い成形色の雲エフェクトが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The first flying type ship in the great ship collection is here!",
			"• Enel's ship \"Ark Maxim\" that appears in One Piece Volume 30 has been made into a three-dimensional figure.",
			"• Each of the propellers on the side of the ship can rotate independently, allowing you to recreate flight for the first time in the series!",
			"• Gloss injection gives distinctive facial areas an amazing shine.",
			"• New display parts and white molded cloud effects are included to recreate Maxim floating in the sky."
		]
	},
